OL,3,AMetal detectorist finds 3,000-year-old
OL,4,Agold bracelet 'worth up to #20k'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving only ever found a silver coin
OL,7,Fwhile metal detecting, Idris Thomas was
OL,8,Fshocked to strike gold - a late Bronze
OL,9,FAge gold bracelet which has been
OL,10,Fdeclared treasure.
OL,12,FBelieved to be about 3,000 years old,
OL,13,Fthe bracelet was found to be 92.8% gold
OL,14,Fby experts from Museum Wales. Brett
OL,15,FHammond, CEO of Timeline Auctions,
OL,16,Festimated its value at between #15,000
OL,17,Fand #20,000. An official value has not
OL,18,Fyet been given.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
