OL,3,AMetal detectorist finds 3,000-year-old
OL,4,Agold bracelet 'worth up to #20k'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas was scanning on farmland
OL,7,Fbelonging to Geraint Edwards, in
OL,8,FLlanuwchllyn, Gwynedd, for about 20
OL,9,Fminutes when his detector alerted him.
OL,11,F"I thought it was another bit of tin
OL,12,Ffoil to begin with, and I just saw a
OL,13,Fflash of gold and dug a little bit
OL,14,Faround it," he said.
